// The WASI p3 set a p3 component builds against, as ONE `generate!` path:
// `path: ["../../wit/p3", <other deps>, "wit"]`. `deps/` links to the vendored
// `0.3.0-rc-2026-03-15` packages beside the p2 ones in `wit/deps` — the rc,
// because comp-host's wasmtime 45 implements the rc and not final `0.3.0`.
// Move the links (and every component's world) to `0.3.0` when the host moves.
package holon:wasi-p3@0.1.0;

world p3 {}
